{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spider_silk","model_identifier":"spider_silk","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## spider_silk\n\nCarried load, monster goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.1..1.1, y -15.0..0.8, z -3.2..3.2 (size 2.2 x 15.8 x 6.4 u = 6 x 44 x 18 cm).\nSpider silk: a skein of glossy white thread (~35 cm) hanging in an oval loop from the fist, with a twisted tie band and one loose thread end. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 15.0.\n"},"description":"## spider_silk\n\nCarried load, monster goods.\n\n- Cubes: 6 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.1..1.1, y -15.0..0.8, z -3.2..3.2 (size 2.2 x 15.8 x 6.4 u = 6 x 44 x 18 cm).\nSpider silk: a skein of glossy white thread (~35 cm) hanging in an oval loop from the fist, with a twisted tie band and one loose thread end. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 15.0.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"loop_top","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.9,-1.0,-1.5],"to":[0.9,0.75,1.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[18,10,19.8,11.75],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,10,15.0,11.75],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[20,10,21.8,11.75],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[15,10,18.0,11.75],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[30,0,31.8,3.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,10,1.8,13.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"730e7e78-b4ea-5fd4-a047-285a60229ed4"},{"name":"side_f","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allo